@startuml AD-001-project-lifecycle
title Complete Project Lifecycle - Activity Diagram
'Requirement: Show full enterprise workflow with parallel agent activities

|Board Member|
start
:Create Project Request;
:Define Goal & Budget;

|CEO Agent|
:Receive Project Request;
:Validate Business Case;
if (Approve Project?) then (yes)
  :Initialize Project;
  :Assign PM Agent;
else (no)
  :Reject Project;
  stop
endif

|PM Agent|
:Review Project Brief;
:Create Initial Backlog;
:Assign BA Agent;

|BA Agent|
:Gather Requirements;
:Analyze Stakeholder Needs;
:Document Use Cases;
:Create Requirement Specs;
:Request Approval;

|Board Member|
:Review Requirements;
if (Approve Requirements?) then (yes)
  :Approve & Continue;
else (no)
  :Request Changes;
  |BA Agent|
  :Revise Requirements;
  stop
endif

|PM Agent|
:Review Requirements;
:Assign Architect Agent;

|Architect Agent|
:Design System Architecture;
:Define Technical Stack;
:Create Architecture Diagrams;
:Document Design Patterns;

|PM Agent|
:Plan Sprint;
:Break Down into Tasks;
:Estimate Effort & Cost;
fork
  |DEV Agent|
  :Receive Development Tasks;
  while (More features?) is (yes)
    :Implement Feature;
    :Write Unit Tests;
    :Document Code;
  endwhile (no)
  :Submit for Review;
fork again
  |QA Agent|
  :Receive Testing Tasks;
  :Prepare Test Cases;
  :Set Up Test Environment;
endfork

|QA Agent|
:Execute Code Review;
:Run Static Analysis;
:Execute Test Suites;
:Check Coverage;
if (Quality Gate Passed?) then (yes)
  :Approve Code;
else (no)
  |DEV Agent|
  :Fix Issues;
  |QA Agent|
  :Re-test;
  stop
endif

|DevOps Agent|
:Receive Deployment Request;
:Build Artifacts;
:Run Security Scan;
if (Security Approved?) then (yes)
  :Deploy to Staging;
  :Run Smoke Tests;
else (no)
  |DEV Agent|
  :Fix Security Issues;
  stop
endif

|Board Member|
:Review Staging Deployment;
if (Approve Production Deploy?) then (yes)
  |DevOps Agent|
  :Deploy to Production;
  :Monitor Deployment;
  :Verify Health Checks;
else (no)
  :Rollback to Previous Version;
  stop
endif

|PM Agent|
:Verify Deployment Success;
:Update Project Status;
:Generate Completion Report;
:Calculate Final Costs;

|CEO Agent|
:Review Project Metrics;
:Archive Project Data;
:Extract Lessons Learned;

|Board Member|
:Receive Final Report;
:Close Project;
stop

@enduml
